        "reason": "Canonical lines 73-94 establish detached rejection, preparation, callback storage and the direct erase-start return without subsequent local cleanup. Lines 14-70 establish nonnegative continuation guards, success-only directory switching/copying, conditional release and clearing a nonnull callback before invocation. The proposed correction matches functionality.md. Lower-layer/caller cleanup, exact negative statuses, overflow and compiled layout are appropriately deferred."
