        "reason": "The file-level explanation accurately distinguishes entry-point immediate returns from callback terminal tails. Canonical lines 18-35 guard both directory switching and copying with result >= 0; lines 54-60 leave successful write initiation pending; lines 38-45 and 63-70 implement conditional release and callback consumption. Existing names remain appropriate, and unchanged inherited knowledge is retained."
      }
