      {
        "reason": "The supersession of fact:5aad33f9-2acc-497e-a242-04da5a0dd8c8 is justified: detached rejection and the direct erase-start return do not execute this unit's callback cleanup tails. Even those tails release only when apiCallback is absent and invoke only a nonnull eraseCallback. The replacement correctly limits the guarantees to their actual branches.",
